OL,3,GNEWSAWe are still living with
OL,4,Adevastation after fire 'like
OL,5,Aapocalyptic film'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne month after a fire tore through an
OL,8,Festate, those affected say they are
OL,9,Fstill living with the resulting
OL,10,Fdevastation.
OL,12,FFour homes were destroyed after a
OL,13,Fdisposable barbecue sparked the
OL,14,FSandyford blaze on 13 August in
OL,15,FStoke-on-Trent, with many other
OL,16,Fproperties also damaged.
OL,18,F"You look through the cracked, broken
OL,19,Fbedroom window and you just see
OL,20,Fsomething out of an apocalyptic film,"
OL,21,Fsaid Carl Woodroffe, who lives on
OL,22,FMaureen Avenue.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
