OL,3,GNEWSAWe are still living with
OL,4,Adevastation after fire 'like
OL,5,Aapocalyptic film'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe grandfather's back garden was
OL,8,Fdestroyed in the fire, which also
OL,9,Fmelted its guttering, broke windows and
OL,10,Fcaused smoke damage at the back of his
OL,11,Fhome.
